{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2017-03", "window": 3, "start_date": 1489622400, "end_date": 1490313599, "month_true_total": 941, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:55:42 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "30695020", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032007565", "personaname": "Vasxazard", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198032007565/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 7526, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7509, "last_played": 1706975852, "avatar": "b5c6def6c2fac34959ddab274d4a99b33ee591e1"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a great free to play game, constantly updatting, pretty friendly community. It is sort of pay to win, with a-lot of grinding elements, but for me that's not really an issue in terms of the enjoyment of the game. It's fast paced action with satisfying gameplay. The interface can take some getting used to, it can be hard to navigate missions. I highely suggest getting a controller, it's murder on your hands if you don't have one, and even when you do if it's a cheap one like I have it's still a bit of an issue. A good game if you have a-lot of free time, very fun. I'd give it about a 7/10.\n\nIn short, great gameplay and community, not for those who can't handle the grind.", "timestamp_created": 1490312696, "timestamp_updated": 1490312696, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "30694905", "author": {"steamid": "76561198363287029", "personaname": "Elne", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/VaginaInspector/", "num_games_owned": 359, "num_reviews": 73, "play